  "description": "Several security issues were discovered in the Linux kernel.\nAn attacker could possibly use these to compromise the system.\nThis update corrects flaws in the following subsystems:\n  - Virtio block driver;\n  - Media drivers;\n  - Network drivers;\n  - Framebuffer layer;\n  - BTRFS file system;\n  - Ext4 file system;\n  - Network file system (NFS) server daemon;\n  - Packet sockets;\n  - VMware vSockets driver;\n(CVE-2025-38618, CVE-2024-35849, CVE-2025-37785, CVE-2024-49924,\nCVE-2025-38617, CVE-2024-27078, CVE-2021-47149, CVE-2021-47319,\nCVE-2025-21796, CVE-2021-47589)\n",
